{"text": "On Christmas Eve, the four March sisters sat by the fire with their mother, Marmee. Jo loved writing. She wrote stories in the attic, and her sisters loved to listen. On Christmas morning, they gave their own breakfast to a poor family. Gentle Beth played the piano, and the house was full of music. In winter, the sisters went skating on the frozen pond, laughing in the snow. In the evening, Marmee read them a letter from their father, and everyone felt warm and happy.", "words": [[0.3, 0.38], [0.48, 0.98], [1.12, 1.38], [1.76, 1.84], [1.92, 2.14], [2.2, 2.5], [2.6, 3.06], [3.18, 3.4], [3.48, 3.62], [3.66, 3.74], [3.82, 4.2], [4.28, 4.42], [4.46, 4.6], [4.68, 4.98], [5.28, 5.64], [7.0, 7.12], [7.32, 7.62], [7.7, 8.24], [8.9, 9.02], [9.1, 9.38], [9.48, 10.0], [10.06, 10.12], [10.16, 10.24], [10.38, 10.8], [11.18, 11.3], [11.36, 11.46], [11.56, 12.04], [12.14, 12.4], [12.46, 12.54], [12.62, 12.98], [14.28, 14.38], [14.48, 14.94], [15.04, 15.44], [15.84, 15.96], [16.04, 16.3], [16.36, 16.52], [16.6, 16.76], [16.84, 17.48], [17.6, 17.68], [17.78, 17.81], [17.88, 18.12], [18.22, 18.66], [19.88, 20.34], [20.4, 20.64], [20.76, 21.04], [21.08, 21.16], [21.2, 21.64], [22.16, 22.26], [22.3, 22.38], [22.48, 22.84], [22.88, 23.02], [23.1, 23.26], [23.3, 23.38], [23.46, 23.96], [25.28, 25.38], [25.46, 25.88], [26.32, 26.4], [26.5, 27.0], [27.08, 27.28], [27.36, 27.84], [27.9, 27.98], [28.02, 28.1], [28.16, 28.56], [28.66, 29.06], [29.52, 29.94], [30.0, 30.08], [30.1, 30.18], [30.3, 30.62], [31.94, 32.02], [32.06, 32.14], [32.28, 32.76], [33.14, 33.48], [33.6, 33.78], [33.82, 33.96], [34.0, 34.03], [34.12, 34.44], [34.5, 34.68], [34.72, 34.86], [34.94, 35.36], [35.82, 35.92], [36.02, 36.46], [36.56, 36.8], [36.92, 37.22], [37.28, 37.38], [37.46, 37.963]], "scenes": [0.0, 6.69, 13.99, 19.62, 24.99, 31.64], "tag": "en-GB-SoniaNeural", "fx": "pb1", "aligned": "ctc1", "clamped": 1}